!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = Mice were fasted for 4-6 hours with access to water before collecing the blood sample. Blood was collected at 6, 12, 18, 24 and 30 weeks of age. About 100μl of blood were collected frmo the tail into RNA protecting tubes. Mice were anaesthetised during blood collection with 2% isoflurane in oxygen and a solution of lidocaine was applied on the tail after the procedure. Mice were sacrificed at 30 weeks of age when the tibialis anterior muscle was also collected.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Total RNA was purified from blood using the Rneasy Protect Animal blood kit and the globin mRNA content was reduced using the globin clear kit. Muscle RNA was purified with Tripure reagent.
